{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_06",
  "title": "Hot Pursuit",
  "storyCode": "DH-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3289dd02a30bc9c976ab3d1b95aa53a2d596eac7c0bd5fa4aad22cc5c85aae22",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Contestant Mizuki gave up obstructing the ambush, headed on top of the arms shop ruins where Ch'en and Lin are buried, halted for a moment and then vanished without a trace."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All of our surveillance and drones have been unable to locate him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And of the teams at the head, Honey Summer has become the first to reach the swimming checkpoint."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All the other teams up front are successively passing through, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And as for our most arresting LUNG wRATh, Ernesto has already been toppled at the rear, and our staff have judged that he's lost the ability to fight on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ch'en and Lin, our two heroines, still show no signs of movement."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could this truly be where it all ends?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ch'en, you're kidding, right? This can't be the place, can it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_190_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss Hoshiguma really cares a lot about the competition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As if. She's got a ton of money riding on Ch'en. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They've known each other for so long now. Who cares whether she wins or loses a competition like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Losing doesn't just mean something's up, and winning isn't gonna prove anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm hoping she loses, really. That's the excuse I need to make fun of her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, Eyjafjalla. Closer. Let me try this facial cream on you. I think it'll make you look great."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_190_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, then. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suddenly, another boom resounds, coming from the screen whose shot is fixed on Ernesto's arms shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hold on, could it be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Onscreen, smoke pours forth, and out from it, pushing a bicycle, Ch'en and Lin Yühsia emerge."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're out, they're out! They're finally out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ch'en and Lin once again stand on the competition stage!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "However, the two only have one bicycle left, and the swimming checkpoint is still a distance away. And at this point, the lead pack have already started on the swim."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do LUNG wRATh really still have a chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get moving. I'll run."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hop on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't make me repeat myself. Hop on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll ride, you sort out anyone in the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's so beautiful. They only have one bicycle left, but Lin refuses to leave Ch'en behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's having Ch'en stand on her own bike's back seat, and as she cycles, Ch'en is ready to handle anyone with a mind to obstruct them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Two people, one single bicycle, and an act of perfect coordination to leave us all in awe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dare I say that right now, their combination is the mightiest in this whole championship!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You stepped on my hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enemies in front. I can't help it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you stop twisting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why don't you try pedaling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ch'en suddenly pushes Lin Yühsia's head down, narrowly avoiding a head-on collision with a tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lin Yühsia then lifts her head back up, and fiercely knocks it into Ch'en's face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yühsia, you—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Accident."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "LUNG wRATh have broken through the final stretch at breakneck speeds, and reached the beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The swimming checkpoint is right before their eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the other teams clearly won't let them through that easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A vicious beach battle is about to commence!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
